{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20143","headline":"别妻家 · 孟郊","name":"别妻家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芙蓉湿晓露，秋别南浦中。\n鸳鸯卷新赠，遥恋东牀空。\n碧水不息浪，清溪易生风。\n参差坐成阻，飘颻去无穷。\n孤云目虽断，明月心相通。\n私情讵销铄，积芳在春藂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}